ence: https://arcade.makecode.com/reference/info/high-score\nThe reference returns the recorded best score with info.high_score().\nMy code stores it in best_score_before_run for the start and end messages.\n============================================================================================================================================================================\n============================================================================================================================================================================\n15. GAME SETUP\nThe introduction appears before the shark controls and countdown are set up below.</comment><value name=\"volume\"><shadow type=\"math_number_minmax\"><mutation min=\"0\" max=\"255\" label=\"Volume\" precision=\"0\"></mutation><field name=\"SLIDER\">100</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"gameSplash\"><mutation xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" _expanded=\"1\" _input_init=\"true\"></mutation><value name=\"title\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">FISH ATTACK</field></shadow></value><value name=\"subtitle\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">Score as much as possible in 2 minutes!</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"controls_if\"><mutation else=\"1\"></mutation><value name=\"IF0\"><shadow type=\"logic_boolean\"><field name=\"BOOL\">TRUE</field></shadow><block type=\"logic_compare\"><field name=\"OP\">GT</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"QK/iK;6j{!r4!a-]E|JN\">best_score_before_run</field></block></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name=\"DO0\"><block type=\"gameSplash\"><mutation xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" _expanded=\"1\" _input_init=\"true\"></mutation><value name=\"title\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\"></field></shadow><block type=\"text_joi